hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1153","Abu Musa told us, Amr bin Yunus told us, Ikrimah, who is Ibn Ammar, told us Yahya bin Abi Kathir, Abu Salama bin Abdul Rahman bin Awf said: I asked Aisha, the Mother of the Believers: With what would the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, begin his prayer when He got up during the night. She said: When he got up during the night, he would open his prayer and say: “O God, Lord of Gabriel, Michael, and Israfil, Creator of the heavens.” And the earth, the Knower of the unseen and the witnessed. You judge between your servants in that in which they differed. Guide me to the truth in that in which they differed, for you are You guide whomever You will to a straight path.”"
